{"id": "113-1-E-058", "year": 113, "session": 1, "subject": "E", "number": 58, "stem": "使用每次2 Gy之分次放射治療一位罹患胸椎轉移腫瘤的病人時，假設有5 cm脊髓神經涵蓋於100%之等劑量曲\n線內，如果希望未來發生輻射性脊髓炎（radiation myelitis）的機會＜1%，總放射劑量值應小於多少較恰\n當？", "options": {"A": "50 Gy", "B": "55 Gy", "C": "60 Gy", "D": "65 Gy"}, "answer": "A", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": false, "figures": [], "source": "sources/113_1/55_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
{"id": "113-1-E-059", "year": 113, "session": 1, "subject": "E", "number": 59, "stem": "進行體外放射治療時常需使用兩照野連接，欲使用兩相鄰照野治療深度位於8 cm處的腫瘤，治療條件為SSD\n＝100 cm，照野寬度分別為16 cm及12 cm，為了避免腫瘤劑量過多的重疊，計算兩相鄰照野邊緣在皮膚表面\n上的間隙應該約為多少？", "options": {"A": "3.0 cm", "B": "2.3 cm", "C": "1.5 cm", "D": "1.1 cm"}, "answer": "D", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": false, "figures": [], "source": "sources/113_1/55_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
